<Layout title="Privacy">
<section class="container page-hero"><span class="eyebrow">PLAIN LANGUAGE. CLEAR INTENT.</span><h1>Your <em>privacy.</em></h1><p class="lead">This notice covers the VortiQuest business website, not applications we host for customers.</p></section>
<section class="container"><div class="prose"><p>Last updated: October 27, 2026.</p><h2>Using this website</h2><p>This website does not set application cookies, use browser storage, run advertising trackers, or collect information through a contact form. Fonts and illustrations are served with the website rather than requested from third-party font services.</p><h2>Hosting and technical information</h2><p>The website is designed to be hosted by Cloudflare. When deployed there, Cloudflare processes technical request information, including IP addresses and browser information, to deliver and protect the site. Its handling of that information is described in <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/">Cloudflare’s privacy policy</a>.</p><h2>When you email us</h2><p>Email links open your chosen email application. If you send a message, VortiQuest receives the information you choose to include, such as your name, email address, and project details. We use it to respond and discuss or provide the services you request. Please avoid sending passwords or sensitive customer data in an initial inquiry.</p><h2>External links</h2><p>Links to other websites take you to services with their own privacy practices. We do not embed those services on this website.</p><h2>Questions</h2><p>For questions about information you have shared with VortiQuest, email <a href="mailto:support@vorti.quest">support@vorti.quest</a>.</p></div></section>
</Layout>
